<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BUY PLN 658 MLN 91-DAY NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BUY PLN 658 MLN 91-DAY NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bought 658 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills after bidding for 960 million zlotys of the papers at the central bank's one billion zloty tender, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>The average yield of the paper rose to 23.50 percent from Tuesday's 23.45 percent average.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
